So that means what's, how do I get to 8?

00:14:34.984 --> 00:14:38.464
Well, we do 7 plus 1, that will give us 8.

00:14:39.495 --> 00:14:40.834
So we can see that we have that total.

00:14:41.464 --> 00:14:43.995
And then when it comes to the
