00:22:00.050 --> 00:22:01.669
Absorbed dose is referred to as a rad.

00:22:01.810 --> 00:22:03.939
So how much radiation have you absorbed?

00:22:04.284 --> 00:22:08.235
Or if you have a gray, or a gray
is the SI unit, so it's joules per

00:22:08.514 --> 00:22:12.175
kilograms of tissue that absorbs,
