What we're going to do
is map this guy out.

00:22:36.260 --> 00:22:37.929
So we have 8.

00:22:37.930 --> 00:22:41.169
0, then we'll go into
half, we'll go down to 4.

00:22:41.170 --> 00:22:43.149
0, we'll do half again,
