00:27:01.860 --> 00:27:04.740
Now when it comes to a nuclear
reactor, is it going to explode?

00:27:04.820 --> 00:27:06.849
No, it's in a controlled process.

00:27:07.089 --> 00:27:09.899
So that way it's a continuous
set of collisions and it'll

00:27:09.930 --> 00:27:11.290
keep releasing energy.

00:27:11.555 --> 00:27:15.335
Every time these different elements split,
