00:27:19.645 --> 00:27:21.254
maintained in their safety conditions.

00:27:21.614 --> 00:27:22.325
We can use it.

00:27:22.325 --> 00:27:25.135
So it's all about hitting it
with a neutron and splitting.

00:27:25.335 --> 00:27:27.265
So it's just something a little
bit different to learn about.

