00:29:39.435 --> 00:29:42.965
So the idea of when it's fusion,
you have two different nucleides

00:29:43.095 --> 00:29:48.555
coming together and it's going to be
making something, a bigger nucleus.

00:29:48.895 --> 00:29:52.595
When it's fission, you have
a neutron being shot at it

00:29:52.625 --> 00:29:53.855
and it's colliding with it.

00:29:54.325 --> 00:29:57.725
So with this case, right on this
first one, you see that we have

00:29:57.725 --> 00:30:01.465
